            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyoko yar’ ameze nk’umuzabibu, nk’uko nawe umeze, nk’ umuzabibu watewe hafi y’amazi, wama cane, ukagira amashami menshi, kubgo kuba ku mazi abugereye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi warikw ishami rinoze ryagizwe inkoni y’umwami y’ubugabe, yar’ inungereye hejuru hagati mu mashami yitwaye intunda, yaribonekeza hejuru n’udushorishori twayo twinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 17:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.13.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 13:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ uwo muzabibu waranduranywe uburake, utsindwa hasi, maz’ umuyaga uva i burasirazuba wumisha inzabibu zawo; rya shami ryawo rinoze rirahanyurwa rirakabirana, umuriro urariturira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 19:13"
